WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Open Off Script. Try a prompt or play with friends.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
In Party Night, choose how many people are playing.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Pick a game. Read the prompt aloud. Everyone has a go.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Browse the Library. Tap Use on an idea you like.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Lock what you love. Reroll the rest.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Tap Save prompt to keep it.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Find your keepers in Saved. On this device.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Off Script. Make it up as you go.
